// M5-A3P-1010. Ch20 U03 layer 3, Virel (Liss), the arrival. act3_ch20.md §2 U03; vowbound §3.
// Memory: a Corrow kitchen the night of the Ch8 wall-fall, a pot still on, a child's shoes by the door. Virel: Wenna
// Corr, the 53rd Cantor, Corrow-born, hidden Saltwright blood; she scratched line-marks into every temple she visited.
// Wenna is giddy and proud to meet a wright. Liss names the marks she found (count by flags); her sail needle if found.
title: ch20_virel
location: ch20/undertow_layers
---
@letterbox on
@camera U12
@music memory_coilspire fade=3.0
@vfx glimmer_held at=kitchen_shapes count=20 rate=slow
@wait 4.0
@camera U13
@anim virel uncoil kitchen_door
@wait 2.0
Virel as "Wenna" [laugh]: A wright! A real one, with the marks and everything! #line:ch20_virel_001 #tn:"Virel speaks as Wenna Corr, a young Corrow woman of hidden Saltwright blood, giddy and proud."
<<if $ch08_liss_found_marks>>
    <<if $ch11_found_wenna_mark and $ch13_found_wenna_mark>>
        Liss [soft_smile]: Coilspire. Lowlight. Ansedra. I found three of your marks. #line:ch20_virel_002
    <<else>>
        <<if $ch11_found_wenna_mark or $ch13_found_wenna_mark>>
            Liss [soft_smile]: I found two of your marks. Coilspire, and one more. #line:ch20_virel_003
        <<else>>
            Liss [soft_smile]: I found your mark at Coilspire. #line:ch20_virel_004
        <<endif>>
    <<endif>>
    Virel as "Wenna" [surprised]: Somebody found them. #line:ch20_virel_005
<<endif>>
<<if $ch08_found_sail_needle>>
    @anim liss show sail_needle
    Virel as "Wenna" [tender]: That's mine. Keep it. #line:ch20_virel_006
<<endif>>
@letterbox off
<<event start_battle ch20_virel>>
===
